        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>36\" Door Threshold ADA Compliant</b>\r\n<p>\r\nDoor Thresholds help seal the doors bottom gap helping to save energy, lowering heating and AC costs. These 36 inch long thresholds are made from non rusting extruded aluminum. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/48-inch-door-threshold\"><b>48\"  Door Threshold</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/72-inch-door-threshold\"><b>72\"  Door Threshold</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nField sizable for doors 28\" to 36\" wide. Powder coated finish.  Packaged with installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for DC-YDT309x-36 Door Threshold\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 36\" threshold is ramped on both sides for easy access. For use on either double acting (door swings both ways) or single acting doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
